  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<p>When you stroll across the Garden District style courtyard, enter through the mahogany doors, and into to the lavishly appointed open floor plan with 20 foot high ceilings, you'll be awe-struck with the sense of elegance and spaciousness. Then, proceed to the gourmet kitchen, equipped with stainless steel Viking appliances, granite countertops, custom cabinetry, and a built-in wine cooler, sure to inspire you with visions of culinary delight. </p><br><br><p>On the second floor you will discover two  bedrooms , one that features a king size bed and ensuite bathroom with a tub/shower combo and double vanity, the other has queen size bed and access to the another bathroom with a tub/shower combo and double vanity. Both have doors leading to a relaxing terrace that overlooks the tranquil courtyard. </p><br><br><p>The entire third floor is occupied by the opulent master suite, which includes a king-size bed, a spacious bathroom suite, and a private balcony overlooking the courtyard's graceful fountains and lush landscape . The bathroom suite features a garden tub, a walk-in shower, and a large double vanity as well as a large walk-in closet.</p><br><br><p>Beyond the courtyard lies the enchanting Village of Baytowne Wharf, where you can indulge in exquisite dining, upscale shopping, lively nightlife, captivating events, enjoyable concerts, spectacular fireworks, and delightful activities for children of all ages.</p><br><br><p>While staying with us, spend some time enjoying the beautiful tropical pool, the relaxing hot & cool tubs, and the fitness center. Grill up some steaks on the provided outdoor gas grills. Take the kids to the Baytowne wharf play ground for a romping good time. Or take the shuttle to the beach and spend the day on the white sand beaches and splashing in the beautiful, clear, emerald hued waters.</p><br><br><p>Located on the Sandestin Golf and Beach Resort**, the gated resort is a unique and charming destination that has been voted the 'Best' resort in Destin, Florida and the #1 resort on Florida's beautiful Emerald Coast. Sandestin is a four-season resort for all ages. There is something for everyone at this magnificent 2,400-acre property, including sugar white sand beaches, full-service beach services, golf for every level of play, a top rated Destin tennis club, water sports, marina, fitness center, spa, biking and walking trails.</p><br><br><p> Complimentary shuttle passes are at your disposal so you can explore the resort with ease and make the most of your time with us.</p><br><br><p>•\t1775 sq ft</p><br><br><p>•\t3 Bedroom, 3 ½ Bath</p><br><br><p>•\tViking Appliances</p><br><br><p>•\tCommunity Pool & Hot Tub</p><br><br><p>•\tFitness Center</p><br><br><p>•\tOutdoor Gas Grills</p><br><br><p>•\tSand Dollar Shuttle Resort Transportation</p><br><br><p>•\tPet Friendly</p><br><br><p>•\tWasher & Dryer</p><br><br><p>•\tWi Fi</p><br><br><p>•\tGarage Parking</p><br><br><p>* Must be 25 years old or older to reserve this property.</p><br><br><p>** SANDESTIN is a federally registered trademark owned by Sandestin Investments, LLC. Beach Vacation DESTINation is in no way affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Sandestin Investments, LLC or the SANDESTIN brand.</p>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Lavish Le Jardin Townhome in Baytowne Wharf- Pet Friendly!"
        }
      ],
